          "text": "They lavish gold out of the bag, and weigh silver in the balance, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hire a goldsmith; and he maketh it a god: they fall down, yes, they worship.",
